# Machine-generated lockfiles — pnpm/npm/yarn each write these in their
# own dialect. Reformatting them with Prettier serves no readability
# purpose (nobody hand-edits a lockfile) and risks Prettier's YAML/JSON
# printer not round-tripping every edge case the package manager relies
# on. Without this, every dependency bump that regenerates the lockfile
# trips a false-positive Format Check failure unrelated to the actual
# change.
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
